@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-55 - Delete Coupon

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Settings UI" as FE
control "CouponsController" as API
control "CouponsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-55
FE -> API: PATCH /coupons/:id active=false
API -> Service: Execute Delete Coupon
Service -> DB: Read/write coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Coupon bị xóa hoặc vô hiệu

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Coupon tồn tại
Post: Coupon bị xóa hoặc vô hiệu
Main flow:
1. Admin chọn coupon
2. Admin bấm Delete
3. System gọi API DELETE /coupons/:id
4. Coupon bị xóa hoặc set isActive = false
end note
@enduml
